a Trombonest with the most immersive VR experience yet. Discover, play, and let every note tell your story.\n\n", "short_description": "Become a Trombonest with your very own VR trombone.\n\nGrab the slide and start tooting!\n\nIn your room with headphones or out loud for all to hear \u2013 play your way!\n\nSelf-paced discovery for novices and experts alike.\n\nTrombonest features:\n\u2022 Three difficulty modes guide you to play notes with perfect pitch.\n\u2022 Simulate embouchure (mouth movements) with the joystick to play different notes.\n\u2022 Visual indicators show you what note you're playing"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://fncore.com/trombonest/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Fncore", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://trombonest.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "7839768739370100"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 22, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1838881343773006"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1291338439838088"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "846753881379836"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "874280898964177"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1569530490977986"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "906869431881708"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2249330425549518"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1